The [b]Community Mod Framework (CMF)[/b] is a utility mod that aims to improve mod inter-operability while giving modders tools for creating new features.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/main/assets/images/cmf/CMF_Banner.png[/img]

[b]CMF should be loaded first in your mod load order.[/b]

Any questions, feel free to reach out on the EU5 Mod Coop Discord: https://discord.gg/aqAAcCZsY7

[h1]Features[/h1]
[list]
 [*][b]Community Mod Menu (CMM):[/b] A shared in-game mod menu. Mod authors register settings dynamically through a simple API, no need to build a custom settings UI.
  [list]
   [*]Toggle, button, numeric, slider (double click to drag), dropdown, text (singleplayer-only), and list settings
   [*]Per-mod tabs, groups, and search
   [*]Global settings with host-only multiplayer editing
   [*]Reset to Defaults
   [*]Draggable window
   [*][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-framework/wiki/CMM-Visual-Editor]CMM Visual Editor[/url]: browser-based tool for creating your mod menu
  [/list]
 [*][b]Custom Alerts:[/b] Create and show custom alerts in the alert bar through localization keys.
 [*][b]Action Bar:[/b] Add custom action bar buttons with localization keys.
 [*][b]Country Transfer:[/b] CMM settings automatically transfer when switching countries (tag switches, inheritance, etc.).
 [*][b]is_host Trigger:[/b] Check if the current country is controlled by the host player.
 [*][b]Unrestricted Tools:[/b] Gate restricted features behind a "Enable Unrestricted Tools" setting (cmf_can_use_unrestricted_tools trigger, cmm_set_requires_unrestricted_tools_enabled per-setting flag).
 [*][b]cmf_suppress Effect:[/b] Suppress "used but never set" and "set but never used" engine warnings with a single effect call.
 [*][b]GUI Macros:[/b] Nand, Nor, and Xor logical operator macros.
 [*][b]On-Action Hooks:[/b] Post-lobby game start and save load hooks (on_game_start_after_lobby, on_game_load, on_game_load_after_lobby) with player country variants. Also includes shared yearly and monthly pulses for human players.
 [*][b]Variable Map Utilities:[/b] Safe variable map mutation helpers (cmf_change_variable_map and local/global variants) that handle remove-then-add atomically.
 [*][b]Log:[/b] Global in-game log for recording mod actions with actor country, action text, and optional arguments.
 [*][b][url=https://github.com/Europa-Universalis-5-Modding-Co-op/community-mod-toolkit]Community Mod Toolkit (CMT):[/url][/b] A companion set of development tools, such as a mod template, workshop uploader, and mod translator.
[/list]

